### Experience Rules

- Company name and location in bold
- Dates on the same line (right aligned in Word)
- Job title in bold on the next line
- Keep all original bullet points
- Do not shorten, merge, rewrite into fewer bullets, or remove content
- No blank line between company, role, and responsibilities

## Final Output Rules

- Produce one ATS-friendly formatted resume
- Align content with the JD without inventing anything
- Preserve all original information
- Preserve all original bullet points
- Focus on professional formatting, grammar, and keyword alignment
- The final output must be ready to copy directly into Microsoft Word with Calibri 11, Narrow margins, and No Spacing style.
